
<html lang='en'>

  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1' />
    <title>Reset Your Password</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
      "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f1f5f9; /* Muted
      background matching frontend */ margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; color:
      #0f172a; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; } .email-container {
      max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; /* Frontend border color */
      box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); /* Matches .surface-card
      */ overflow: hidden; } .header { background-color: #0054a8; /* Frontend
      primary color: hsl(215, 100%, 33%) */ color: #ffffff; padding: 24px;
      text-align: center; } .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.5px; } .content { padding: 40px 32px;
      text-align: center; } .content p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;
      color: #334155; margin: 0 0 24px 0; } .otp-container { background-color:
      #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px;
      margin: 32px auto; max-width: 320px; } .otp-label { display: block;
      font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform:
      uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: 600; } .otp-code { display:
      inline-block; background-color: #e33b4e; /* Frontend secondary color for
      emphasis */ color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; } .footer {
      margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      text-align: center; } .footer p { font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin:
      0; }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class='email-container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
      </div>
      <div class='content'>
        <p>
          We received a request to reset your password. Use the verification
          code below to choose a new one.
        </p>

        <div class='otp-container'>
          <span class='otp-label'>Your Verification Code</span>
          <span class='otp-code'>{{code}}</span>
        </div>

        <div class='footer'>
          <p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>

</html>